menu "DashCar"

config DASHCAR_SELFTEST
    bool "Run the scripted touch self-test after boot"
    default n
    help
        Debug only. Builds main/debug/selftest.c and starts it ~12 s after boot. Use
        tools/selftest.sh, which builds into build-selftest/ so normal builds never include it.

config DASHCAR_SOAK
    bool "Run the ~35 min soak test (simulated drive + UI user + monitor) after boot"
    default n
    help
        Debug only. Builds main/debug/soak.c. Use tools/soak.sh, which builds into build-soak/ and needs
        the phone hotspot (real downloads are part of the workload). Trip totals and the parking spot
        use separate NVS keys in this build, so the real ones are untouched.

endmenu
